# One lockfile. This project installs with bun, and every CI job does too. package-lock.json used to
# sit beside bun.lock because the unit tests ran on Node; on 2026-09-20 the two disagreed about
# kinetix-contracts and the build compiled against a different contract than the tests would have
# used. Anyone running `npm install` here regenerates it, so it is ignored rather than merely deleted.
package-lock.json
